91,English - OP18,,0,0,0,,and keep on going through the hard knock days.Dialogue: 1,0:01:29.91,0:01:31.67,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,sDialogue: 2,0:01:29.99,0:01:30.43,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,suDialogue: 2,0:01:30.13,0:01:30.67,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,suDialogue: 2,0:01:30.37,0:01:30.84,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,muDialogue: 2,0:01:30.54,0:01:31.06,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,beDialogue: 2,0:01:30.76,0:01:31.31,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,kiDialogue: 2,0:01:31.01,0:01:31.67,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,hardDialogue: 2,0:01:31.37,0:01:32.07,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,knockDialogue: 2,0:01:31.67,0:01:34.83,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,daysDialogue: 0,0:01:49.07,0:01:53.78,Captions,,0,0,170,,Fourth Level - The Sunflower FieldDialogue: 0,0:01:49.72,0:01:51.84,Main,,0,0,3,,Well?  What are you gonna do?Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.92,0:01:53.70,Main,,0,0,3,,What are you gonna do?Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.98,0:01:57.10,Main,,0,0,0,,The ground is rippling like a flag.Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.36,0:02:02.90,Main,,0,0,0,,How pathetic! Just grovel in the dust, Toy Soldier!Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.43,0:02:08.67,Title,,0,0,240,,Cabbage and LomeoDialogue: 0,0:02:06.16,0:02:08.80,Main,,0,0,0,,I get it!  It all makes sense now.Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.50,0:02:13.92,Main,,0,0,0,,The toy soldier who was crying and screaming so disgracefully back then...Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.10,0:02:16.36,Main,,0,0,0,,That was you!Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.84,0:02:27.77,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Scarlett!Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.16,0:02:36.44,Main,,0,0,0,,You're the late Scarlett's husband and Rebecca's father.Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.48,0:02:43.14,Main,,0,0,0,,This is great!Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.52,0:02:47.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Looks like you and I are bound by karma, eh Kyros?Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.40,0:02:49.46,Main,,0,0,0,,That's right!Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.99,0:02:51.58,Main,,0,0,0,,That's why I came here!Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.38,0:02:58.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, oops... That was a good move!Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.10,0:03:01.64,Main,,0,0,0,,But it's a steel cape. Watch out!Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.94,0:03:07.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Vipera Glaive!Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.94,0:03:07.10,Note,,0,0,0,,Snake SwordDialogue: 0,0:03:18.82,0:03:19.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Father!Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.02,0:03:24.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Father, I'll fight, too!Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.34,0:03:30.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah!  Fight, Rebecca!  I'll kill you!Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.26,0:03:38.42,Main,,0,0,0,,I wanna watch Kyros lose both his wife and daughter!Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.76,0:03:39.98,Main,,0,0,0,,It's okay, Rebecca!Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.22,0:03:43.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Let me protect you, as well as atone for Scarlett's death!Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.94,0:03:50.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Let me compensate for teaching you how to fight!Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.44,0:03:55.03,Main,,0,0,0,,I've been living with regret and shame for it until today!Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.50,0:04:03.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Now that I've become human once more, I will never let my daughter swing a sword again!Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.48,0:04:18.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Th-This is terrible...Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.84,0:04:22.65,Captions,,0,0,170,,Royal Palace Grounds - Second LevelDialogue: 0,0:04:19.42,0:04:22.30,Main,,0,0,3,,Lao G-sama was taken out!Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.26,0:04:25.66,Main,,0,0,0,,That's some power.Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.16,0:04:30.48,Main,,0,0,0,,I've heard that name before.Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.78,0:04:33.26,Main,,0,0,0,,The Happou Navy from the Flower Kingdom.Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.76,0:04:34.92,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll keep it in mind.Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.10,0:04:37.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Anyone can become our enemy at any time.Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.44,0:04:40.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Gramps! Hey, Gramps!Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.06,0:04:42.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't die, Gramps!Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.28,0:04:47.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Then I'll reserve two ceremonial halls, honey!Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.38,0:04:49.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Ceremonial halls?! Honey?!Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.46,0:04:51.56,Main,,0,0,0,,For the wedding and...Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.74,0:04:53.06,Main,,0,0,0,,the funeral.Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.20,0:04:54.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't write us off!Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.58,0:04:58.36,Captions,,0,0,170,,Royal Palace Grounds - Third LevelDialogue: 0,0:04:58.62,0:05:02.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Why are you crawling and slinking around?Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.36,0:05:04.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Now, fight me, Gladius!Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.06,0:05:07.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't push your luck.Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.16,0:05:16.08,Main,,0,0,0,,What the...Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.36,0:05:20.98,Main,,0,0,0,,No! Gladius-sama, you can't!Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.78,0:05:27.90,Main,,0,0,0,,The ground is inflating!?Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.55,0:05:31.42,Main,,0,0,0,,You know what'll happen, don't you?Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.89,0:05:34.44,Main,,0,0,0,,You were preparing for this?Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.20,0:05:40.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Watch out!Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.20,0:05:41.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Run!Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.80,0:05:46.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, Bartolomeo! Everything's gonna blow!Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.02,0:05:48.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Let me inside your barrier!Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.58,0:05:49.57,Main,,0,0,0,,No way!Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.72,0:05:50.42,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.58,0:05:55.26,Main,,0,0,0,,If I open it, Robin-senpai and I will be in danger, and our enemies will come inside as well!Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.50,0:05:58.50,Main,,0,0,0,,No, open it! I'm on your side!Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.66,0:06:01.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Gladius-sama! We'll be caught up in it, too...Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.56,0:06:04.62,Main,,0,0,0,,It'll be fine. You guys are elite, right?Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.40,0:06:07.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Open up!Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.80,0:06:09.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Pop Rock...Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.87,0:06:10.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Festival!Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.55,0:06:30.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, Cavendish.Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.70,0:06:40.74,Main,,0,0,0,,If I'd been outside right now, I'd be a dead man.Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.60,0:06:45.52,Main,,0,0,0,,You ingrate!Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.62,0:06:47.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Why'd you wait so long to let me in?!Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.60,0:06:48.92,Main,,0,0,0,,I thought I was gonna die!Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.86,0:06:51.24,Main,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you?!Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.50,0:06:54.26,Main,,0,0,0,,That's no way to talk to the guy who just saved your life!Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.34,0:06:57.64,Main,,0,0,0,,I was covering you before that! Now we're even!Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.58,0:07:01.44,Main,,0,0,0,,I've had enough! I'm going to attack them!Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.54,0:07:02.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Let me out!Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.52,0:07:03.62,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.74,0:07:06.84,Main,,0,0,0,,I just let you in, and now you want out?!Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.96,0:07:10.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Since you came in, why don't you stay for a while, you selfish fool?!Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.02,0:07:12.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Is this an inn?!Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.32,0:07:14.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Offense must come after defense! That's how it should be!Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.64,0:07:19.36,Main,,0,0,0,,I won't let you in next time!Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.56,0:07:21.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Let me in again when I'm in danger!Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.04,0:07:23.96,Main,,0,0,0,,You're so unreasonable!Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.74,0:07:27.36,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll get you for this later!Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.18,0:07:29.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, Robin-senpai!Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.90,0:07:40.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, great!  She's alright!Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.94,0:07:43.61,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I'll be there, Rebecca!  Stay safe!Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.22,0:07:48.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Nico Robin, you cumbersome woman!Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.56,0:07:54.14,Main,,0,0,0,,I won't let you get in the way of the top commanders anymore!Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.54,0:07:56.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Catapult Pop!Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.42,0:08:04.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Bari-ability: Racket!Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.22,0:08:15.28,Main,,0,0,0,,He's still alive?!Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.42,0:08:18.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Advance! Robin-senpai!Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.72,0:08:19.64,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Rooster-kun!Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.60,0:08:21.43,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Thank you!Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.58,0:08:25.06,Main,,0,0,0,,S-She made an eye gesture, a.k.a. a wink!Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.68,0:08:30.58,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm so grateful!Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.68,0:08:36.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Did it mean, "Good job, Rooster-kun! You can become my slave if you want"?!Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.84,0:08:41.94,Main,,0,0,0,,No no, you're being too presumptuous, Bartolomeo!  You're asking for too much!Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.16,0:08:43.34,Main,,0,0,0,,But!Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.48,0:08:46.37,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm getting real fired up!Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.86,0:08:53.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Cavendish, you were in the barrier, too?!Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.04,0:08:55.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Too bad, Gladius!Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.14,0:08:57.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Blade of Beauty: Blue...Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.63,0:08:58.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Bracchium...Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.93,0:09:01.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Gladius-sama!Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.88,0:09:11.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Bartolomeo!Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.60,0:09:15.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Barrier Bulls!Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.52,0:09:18.64,Main,,0,0,0,,The barrier is charging at us!Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.76,0:09:25.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Robin-senpai! To a man, your eye gesture is worth risking his life!Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.50,0:09:35.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop, Bartolomeo! Can't you see I'm here?!Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.14,0:09:38.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Cabbage! But there's a reason I can't stop!Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.62,0:09:39.76,Main,,0,0,0,,And that is?!Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.34,0:09:42.00,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm... so fired up!Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.00,0:09:43.82,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm... so fired up!Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.96,0:09:45.00,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't care!Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.08,0:09:47.30,Main,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about, you fool?! Stop now!Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.38,0:09:48.66,Main,,0,0,0,,No can do!Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.24,0:09:52.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Dellinger!Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.12,0:09:55.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Haven't you cleaned up the second level yet?!Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.50,0:09:58.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Gladius! What are you doing?Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.34,0:10:00.26,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll be finished here soon!Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.52,0:10:02.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Come and help on the third level!Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.66,0:10:04.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Nico Robin is trying to make her way up!Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.19,0:10:07.52,Main,,0,0,0,,My hands are full with these two idiots!Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.38,0:10:10.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Roger! Sounds like fun!Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.36,0:10:15.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Didn't I tell you...Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.10,0:10:19.44,Main,,0,0,0,,to pay attention?!Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.62,0:10:22.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Boy, you're so persistent, you Longhand!Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.91,0:10:30.68,Main,,0,0,0,,I did think those protrusions on your shoulders were weird.Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.62,0:10:34.56,Main,,0,0,0,,You got a hole in your damn stomach!Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.70,0:10:37.40,Main,,0,0,0,,So why don't you drop dead already, Martial Arts Champion?Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.64,0:10:39.29,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't do that!Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.68,0:10:42.26,Main,,0,0,0,,You gotta have a sense of duty and obligation in a man's world!Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.73,0:10:45.58,Main,,0,0,0,,I must fight for the sake of those who have already fallen!Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.32,0:10:47.88,Main,,0,0,0,,That's so not you.Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.84,0:10:52.06,Main,,0,0,0,,If you played dead or something, I would've spared your life.Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.38,0:10:55.98,Main,,0,0,0,,How will staying on your feet help?!Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.28,0:11:00.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Maybe I can buy some time.Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.48,0:11:05.66,Main,,0,0,0,,We've gotta keep you guys from getting in Straw Hat's way...Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.78,0:11:08.70,Main,,0,0,0,,so that he can defeat Doflamingo!Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.82,0:11:10.68,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll do it together!Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.48,0:11:15.98,Main,,0,0,0,,There's no such thing as victory attained by one person alone, kid!Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.78,0:11:23.94,Main,,0,0,0,,So you guys are trying to attain victory by sacrificing your lives.Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.02,0:11:28.90,Main,,0,0,0,,That's how vermin act!Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.82,0:11:32.48,Main,,0,0,0,,The strong don't heed obligations!Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.96,0:12:08.74,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm no ordinary human, either.Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.40,0:12:14.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't underestimate my Fighting Fish lineage!Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.34,0:12:28.12,Captions,,900,0,260,,3rd stepDialogue: 0,0:12:33.32,0:12:36.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Gladius! I'm here!Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.88,0:12:38.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Where are you?Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.64,0:12:45.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Gladius!Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.80,0:12:48.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Dellinger, stay on the lower level! It's dangerous here!Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.40,0:12:50.98,Main,,0,0,0,,We have one troublesome enemy!Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.86,0:12:54.46,Main,,0,0,0,,That doesn't sound like you!Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.58,0:12:58.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Gladius, nobody can oppose us when we fight together-Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.92,0:13:08.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Dellinger!Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.10,0:13:29.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn!  Dellinger...Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.60,0:13:33.76,Main,,0,0,0,,What the...Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.98,0:13:35.58,Main,,0,0,0,,What just happened?!Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.84,0:13:40.24,Main,,0,0,0,,That brat with horns and all the other enemy soldiers...Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.02,0:13:42.84,Main,,0,0,0,,He took 'em all down.Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.40,0:13:50.88,Main,,0,0,0,,There's this kinda scary guy on the other side of the barrier!Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.62,0:13:58.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Wh-Who's that?Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.42,0:14:04.40,Main,,0,0,0,,He looks like Cabbage, but his face is totally different.Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.84,0:14:20.38,Main,,0,0,0,,This is exactly the same thing that happened in the Block D match at the Colosseum.Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.84,0:14:25.48,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Oh my, everyone's gone down!Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.94,0:14:36.76,Main,,0,0,0,,That was this guy's doing?Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.96,0:14:40.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Those clothes are undoubtedly Cavendish's.Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.40,0:14:43.18,Main,,0,0,0,,But the face looks undoubtedly like somebody else-dish.Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.34,0:14:46.54,Main,,0,0,0,,So what kinda-vendish is he?Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.54,0:14:52.72,Main,,0,0,0,,T-That scared me!Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.90,0:14:54.84,Main,,0,0,0,,He was so fast, I couldn't see him!Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.70,0:15:01.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, no matter how fast you can move, it's useless against my ability!Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.82,0:15:03.98,Main,,0,0,0,,What the hell're you thinking?!Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.14,0:15:07.50,Main,,0,0,0,,What's happened to you?! If you take this joke too far...Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.48,0:15:17.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! Who did you just glance at?!Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.76,0:15:21.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't do anything stupid! Hey! Hey!Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.42,0:15:29.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't!Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.26,0:15:36.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't go after Robin-senpai!Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.10,0:15:55.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Your speed is useless against me.Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.30,0:15:58.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Your face has become quite ugly.Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.36,0:16:01.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Cabbage-kun, did you want something from me?Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.56,0:16:12.80,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm worried about Rebecca, so I must hurry to the top.Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.32,0:16:20.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Wow! Cool! She stopped him!Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.43,0:16:23.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Dobin-sedbai!Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.06,0:16:31.46,Main,,0,0,0,,I knew it was too audacious of a weakling like me to try to protect you!Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.14,0:16:46.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Wait, Hakuba!Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.96,0:16:54.96,Main,,0,0,0,,I didn't give you permission to come out!Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.12,0:17:01.58,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Nico Robin.Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.82,0:17:03.60,Main,,0,0,0,,I almost cut you.Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.76,0:17:06.20,Main,,0,0,0,,So that was this "Hakuba" I've heard about.Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.86,0:17:08.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Your other personality...Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.92,0:17:10.96,Main,,0,0,0,,That's right...Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.96,0:17:14.66,Main,,0,0,0,,He's bad news.Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.86,0:17:17.24,Main,,0,0,0,,He kills indiscrimi-Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.44,0:17:24.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Your hands and feet...Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.99,0:17:29.60,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll chop them and what's left of you into bits, Nico Robin!Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.33,0:17:32.62,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll slice up everything!Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.66,0:17:41.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Stay away, Hakuba! I won't let you take control!Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.70,0:17:45.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Shut up! Stay asleep, Cavendish!Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.30,0:17:49.16,Main,,0,0,0,,You don't even know what I'm fighting for!Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.30,0:17:50.52,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll take care of this!Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.06,0:17:53.16,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll just rip everything to shreds!Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.26,0:17:55.30,Main,,0,0,0,,There's no point if I don't do it!Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.40,0:17:58.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't care! I'll show them a bloodbath!Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.10,0:18:02.36,Main,,0,0,0,,It's like two people having a conversation! Does he have a split personality?!Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.42,0:18:03.14,Main,,0,0,0,,I will!Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.32,0:18:04.20,Main,,0,0,0,,No, me!Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.48,0:18:05.55,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll do it!Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.55,0:18:06.55,Main,,0,0,0,,No, I will!Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.55,0:18:07.38,Main,,0,0,0,,I will!Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.76,0:18:09.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Me, me, me! Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.85,0:18:11.97,Main,,0,0,0,,I will, I will, I will !Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.10,0:18:12.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Me!Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.68,0:18:13.24,Main,,0,0,0,,I will!Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.48,0:18:13.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Me!Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.96,0:18:14.52,Main,,0,0,0,,I will!Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.78,0:18:15.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Me!Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.35,0:18:15.98,Main,,0,0,0,,I will!Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.22,0:18:17.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Me!Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.12,0:18:19.06,Main,,0,0,0,,I will!Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.12,0:18:19.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Me!Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.20,0:18:22.22,Main,,0,0,0,,He's gone half-and-half!Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.04,0:18:26.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Shut up, Hakuba!Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.48,0:18:30.98,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm the only Cavendish!Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.56,0:18:34.46,Main,,0,0,0,,You were half-and-half just a second ago!Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.10,0:18:40.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay, it's alright now, Nico Robin.Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.60,0:18:42.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Why don't you let go of me?Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.88,0:18:45.54,Main,,0,0,0,,You expect me to trust you after seeing that?Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.12,0:18:50.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.52,0:18:53.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's just end this now.Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.66,0:19:01.12,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll blow you up along with the wall!Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.22,0:19:04.62,Main,,0,0,0,,This'll do far worse than just throw you into the air.Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.93,0:19:07.14,Main,,0,0,0,,You're not getting away in one piece!Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.86,0:19:11.34,Main,,0,0,0,,That bastard!Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.48,0:19:13.24,Main,,0,0,0,,He'll rupture us along with the wall!Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.70,0:19:17.18,Main,,0,0,0,,We need to get down right now, Nico Robin!Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.34,0:19:21.34,Main,,0,0,0,,No! Something could happen to Rebecca while I'm doing that...Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.46,0:19:23.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Leave this to me!Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.56,0:19:28.30,Main,,0,0,0,,I won't let him harm Robin-senpai!Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.50,0:19:29.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Good judgment.Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.22,0:19:34.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, if you take me down, you can stop the wall from rupturing.Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.96,0:19:38.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Punk Hair!Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.46,0:19:50.16,Main,,0,0,0,,What's this? It went numb.Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.96,0:19:52.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Those hairs are poison needles.Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.83,0:19:53.39,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.39,0:19:54.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Bartolomeo!Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.84,0:19:57.24,Main,,0,0,0,,I have the power of the Rupture Fruit.Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.20,0:20:05.54,Main,,0,0,0,,In other words, I'm a rupture man from head to toe.Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.67,0:20:12.66,Main,,0,0,0,,If you do something to me, my body will explode...Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.72,0:20:17.42,Main,,0,0,0,,and thousands more of the poison needles that just caught you...Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.04,0:20:20.18,Main,,0,0,0,,will pierce through those two up there!Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.72,0:20:28.00,Main,,0,0,0,,But if you don't take me down, you can't stop the wall from rupturing.Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.36,0:20:29.90,Main,,0,0,0,,What are you gonna do?Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.22,0:20:34.70,Main,,0,0,0,,My body's explosion will be so powerful that you can't survive, of course.Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.00,0:20:39.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Then Robin-senpai will suffer no matter what I do!Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.86,0:20:42.86,Main,,0,0,0,,You're a fast learner, Bartolomeo.Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.18,0:20:46.14,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Think, Bartolomeo!Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.25,0:20:50.08,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,What's the most important thing for me to keep safe here?Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.76,0:20:53.32,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,That's obviously...Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.84,0:20:55.90,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Robin-senpai's body.Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.38,0:20:58.84,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,To stop the wall from rupturing,Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.16,0:21:01.64,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I've gotta take that hedgehog down.Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.08,0:21:07.08,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,But then, all those poison needles will fly straight toward Robin-senpai!Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.90,0:21:12.04,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,What should I do? Think!Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.68,0:21:14.86,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Think harder, Bartolomeo!Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.02,0:21:19.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah!Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.40,0:21:23.76,Main,,0,0,0,,There's a completely expendable guy up there with Robin-senpai!Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.17,0:21:28.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, Cabbage! I'll bring down the hedgehog here, so...Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.80,0:21:33.89,Main,,0,0,0,,you protect Robin-senpai from the poison needles by using your whole body as a shield!Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.78,0:21:35.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey...Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.76,0:21:36.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, Cabbage!Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.66,0:21:38.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Shut up, rooster!Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.58,0:21:41.16,Main,,0,0,0,,The evil one came out again!Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.34,0:21:44.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Just when I need him the most, he's useless!Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.77,0:21:50.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Robin-senpai's in danger from all sides!Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.93,0:21:52.52,Main,,0,0,0,,What do I do?! What do I do?!Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.62,0:21:55.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah!Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.94,0:22:13.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Will you face me, Bartolomeo?Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.86,0:22:16.42,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I can only put up one barrier at a time.Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.50,0:22:20.08,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,That's the drawback, but I don't care.Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.22,0:22:29.46,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Robin-senpai! If I can save you, I won't hesitate!Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.52,0:22:34.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Barrier Ball!Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.80,0:22:37.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Go ahead, blow up if you like!Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.72,0:22:40.76,Main,,0,0,0,,We're inside my unbreakable barrier!Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.88,0:22:41.60,Main,,0,0,0,,This fool...Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.26,0:22:50.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Rooster-kun! Don't tell me you...Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.64,0:22:56.18,Main,,0,0,0,,You were prepared to take me down with you?!Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.42,0:22:57.62,Main,,0,0,0,,You insolent little...Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.82,0:23:00.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Fashion Pop!Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.50,0:23:07.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Rooster-kun!Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.22,0:23:11.36,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,That serves you right, hedgehog!Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.80,0:23:16.00,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Now the wall won't rupture!Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.92,0:23:19.48,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I did it...Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.84,0:23:23.30,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I protected Robin-senpai.Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.40,0:23:34.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Too bad for you, fool.Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.62,0:23:39.62,Main,,0,0,0,,You missed by just a few centimeters.Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.52,0:23:44.71,Main,,0,0,0,,It wasn't my throat that you stabbed.  It was my shoulder.Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.72,0:23:47.42,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I-I missed his vital organs?!Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.70,0:23:51.94,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Sure, he was inflated and I couldn't tell if it was his neck or shoulder but...Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.27,0:23:53.76,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Dammit!Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.30,0:23:58.40,Main,,0,0,0,,You have Devil Fruit powers too, so you know the deal.Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.70,0:24:01.80,Main,,0,0,0,,As long as I'm conscious...Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.65,0:24:07.06,Main,,0,0,0,,The wall rupture won't stop!Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.58,0:24:12.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Watch closely as your friends are blown asunder!Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.94,0:24:17.76,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Damn, I'm such a fool!Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.04,0:24:22.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Nico Robin, I'm sorry!Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.54,0:24:25.06,Main,,0,0,0,,I brought Hakuba under control!Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.32,0:24:27.12,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm Cavendish now!Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.72,0:24:30.36,Main,,0,0,0,,But I left half of me as Hakuba.Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.82,0:24:34.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Let go of me! I'll kill you!Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.98,0:24:38.52,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll take you to the Sunflower Field with Hakuba's speed!Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.88,0:24:41.02,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll use Hakuba's abilities!Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.42,0:24:43.98,Main,,0,0,0,,We have no other options! Let go of me!Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.22,0:24:45.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Trust me!Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.98,0:24:47.84,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Which one's talking?Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.00,0:24:49.61,Main,,0,0,0,,No time to think!Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.30,0:24:51.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Hurry up!Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.14,0:24:53.74,Main,,0,0,0,,D-Don't!Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.82,0:24:54.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Pop Rock...Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.16,0:25:00.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Super Arena!Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.08,0:25:08.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Robin-senpai!Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.48,0:25:14.16,Main,,0,0,0,,This barrier of yours is quite convenient.Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.12,0:25:24.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Look.Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.56,0:25:27.76,Main,,0,0,0,,There's nothing left of either one.Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.00,0:25:28.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?!Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.26,0:25:34.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Why did you stop me?!Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.04,0:25:36.96,Main,,0,0,0,,It's your own body!Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.92,0:25:40.10,Main,,0,0,0,,If so, why don't you...Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.52,0:25:43.08,Main,,0,0,0,,listen to me every now and then?!Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.82,0:25:48.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Cien Fleur! Spider Net!Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.82,0:25:48.64,Note,,0,0,0,,Hundred Flower Spider NetDialogue: 0,0:25:55.00,0:25:58.74,Main,,0,0,0,,You stopped Hakuba's sword for me, didn't you, Cabbage-kun?Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.60,0:26:02.04,Main,,0,0,0,,You're such a confusing man.Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.40,0:26:05.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Impossible!Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.86,0:26:08.18,Main,,0,0,0,,How could they escape that rupture?!Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.00,0:26:18.28,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Compared to him, I'm pathetic!Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.82,0:26:21.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Divine Homage Fist!Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.96,0:26:26.44,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Luffy-senpai...Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.76,0:26:29.64,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,My skills aren't good enough now...Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.78,0:26:32.39,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,But I'll become stronger and stronger...Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.86,0:26:35.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Barrier...Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.66,0:26:42.54,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I swear, that someday...Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.88,0:26:48.49,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I'll become a man who can help you!Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.92,0:26:53.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Pistol!Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.91,0:27:13.89,Main,,0,0,0,,I barely won using my senpai's power...Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.64,0:27:19.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I never want to...Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.96,0:27:22.12,Main,,0,0,0,,work with that annoying guy again!Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.62,0:27:28.00,Captions,,0,0,335,,4th Step Sunflower HillDialogue: 0,0:27:30.40,0:27:32.74,Main,,0,0,0,,It's quite noisy down there, too.Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.28,0:27:35.58,Main,,0,0,0,,On an unstable battlefield like this,Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.68,0:27:39.78,Main,,0,0,0,,even a gladiator from the Colosseum would totter and fall!Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.06,0:27:42.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Right, Rebecca?Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.72,0:27:44.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Vipera Glaive!Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.72,0:27:44.76,Note,,0,0,0,,Snake SwordDialogue: 0,0:27:44.92,0:27:48.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't! Run, Rebecca! You can't stop that attack!Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.14,0:27:52.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Butterfly flowers that divert attacks...Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.22,0:27:53.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Mil Fleur!Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.22,0:27:53.26,Note,,0,0,0,,Thousand FlowerDialogue: 0,0:27:57.76,0:27:58.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Moth Orchid!Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.02,0:28:01.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Robin-san!Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.26,0:28:03.14,Main,,0,0,0,,That's...Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.30,0:28:04.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Robiland!Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.88,0:28:08.26,Main,,0,0,0,,You've completed your objective, Rebecca.Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.64,0:28:11.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you for delivering the key.Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.26,0:28:14.62,Main,,0,0,0,,From now on, I'll defend you!Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.95,0:28:20.00,OP11 Credits,,0,0,0,,Editing:  Galaxy 9000  Timing:  Datenshi, Sewil (Opening)  Quality Assurance:  Mr Luffy, Galaxy 9000, Grug, Datenshi  Soundtracking:  Halee  TC/Infoboxes:  Datenshi  Translation: Yibis